     1338   end.
     1339   rep-rec = del-rec.
     1340   run OpenBr in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).
     1341   END.
     1342   ON CHOOSE OF B-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1343   DO:
     1344     DEFINE VARIABLE v-rid-list AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
