     1396       END.
     1397       run PrintProc.
     1398       reposition br-wthpl to recid doc-rec no-error.
     1399       apply "entry" to br-wthpl in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1400   END.
     1401   ON CHOOSE OF B-sch IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1402   DO:
     1403     run proc-b-sch no-error.
     1404     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1405   END.
     1406   ON CHOOSE OF B-sel IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1407   DO:
